{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_6000_situation", "source_sha256": "ac7e4d413418fb8817f907a97d65f00072cd2e812c693fd3e53106bb73ef6dba", "ja": "グラビア撮影のお仕事", "zh": "写真摄影的工作", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_6000_place", "source_sha256": "50e85f6048dba95cd072eda4ef3ea5d00b24b63894dc064d413fb1cf4847d4f9", "ja": "ビュッフェ会場", "zh": "自助餐会场", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_6001_p", "source_sha256": "9b7ef1170e2ef48f2e089fad953720a5d413df19a237cc0ab66b2b5aa0d26150", "ja": "（今日は真と、グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影。\nテーマはティーパーティーということだけど……）", "zh": "（今天要和真一起拍摄写真杂志《爱格拉！！》。主题虽然是茶会，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_6002_006mak", "source_sha256": "bb74464a8bb87bac29946dcf00625cfc2f5662aa935ac906f8f8f19e70795a3d", "ja": "{$P$}、ボクのティーパーティーに\nようこそ！　お茶とハッピーを届けちゃいますよ！", "zh": "{$P$}，欢迎来到我的茶会！我会把茶与幸福送到你身边哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_6003_p", "source_sha256": "85e3ec12047ba98ee94c7a5c4b1a613ae68a12370b2be66706f9de5b3d996faa", "ja": "おっ、バッチリみたいだな。パーティーを\n楽しんでほしいって気持ちが伝わってくるよ。", "zh": "哦，看起来很完美嘛。能感受到你希望大家享受这场派对的心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_6004_006mak", "source_sha256": "b91c3818b363aa6e534dcc3a83d451dc129a7db99fc61c268c5c97f474fa4f29", "ja": "へへっ、よかったです。今日は主催として\nガンガン盛り上げていきますよ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，太好了。今天我作为主办方，会使劲把气氛炒热的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_6005_006mak", "source_sha256": "dc5aac055cba0dfdb15a758b9427a9d2b97be0ddd66610a7e2a2915838521b8a", "ja": "それに……今日はこのカワイイ衣装ですからね♪\nカワイイ成分もバッチリ伝えていくつもりです！", "zh": "而且……今天还穿着这么可爱的服装♪\n我打算把可爱元素也充分传达给大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_6006_p", "source_sha256": "a91d0519427f057417d0333c7b0204ff796e6c6460d5a6acbbe28681e61561d7", "ja": "カワイイ成分を伝える、か……。具体的には\nどんなふうにしようと思ってるんだ？", "zh": "要传达可爱成分啊……具体来说，你打算怎么做？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_6007_006mak", "source_sha256": "aef8670175a7823387745ccf245351c0e14699361fef072dc14d579cbd9a9f4e", "ja": "そうですね……。思わずキュン♪　ってなるような\nおもてなしがしたいんですけど……。", "zh": "是啊……我想用那种让人不由得心动♪的待客方式……嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_6008_006mak", "source_sha256": "9c790f78b998aa7972d7220bde76a5a762765d494efa546c5e153aff941f792b", "ja": "何をしたらカワイさが一番伝わるかなあ……。\n{$P$}は、どう思いますか？", "zh": "怎样才能把可爱最充分地传达出来呢……  \n{$P$}，你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_6009", "source_sha256": "b527d55da7150f89b84d42137c31e315bd9f7707e8b247e9ff35dea4cba2d6b2", "ja": "特製ドリンク作り", "zh": "制作特饮", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_6010", "source_sha256": "42793e6faf165603e4d2f0152f9d7e6ef33cf4dae099ac8cf7f931c0a3ea40f0", "ja": "お菓子の取り分け", "zh": "分配点心", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_6011", "source_sha256": "50de533f231c601b8889da3f398c5d29bcb33c93dc6f9705b7b33485370a459f", "ja": "ウサギ跳びレッスン", "zh": "兔跳训练", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_6100_p", "source_sha256": "f7d46c88dea325e3fa8396bccdc9dc7e7a98da1891c0d322027d878401768c66", "ja": "特製ドリンク作りなんてどうだ？　\n色とか飾り次第で、いろいろ工夫できそうだし。", "zh": "试试制作特制饮料怎么样？\n只要在颜色和装饰上下功夫，应该能做出各种不同的花样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_6101_006mak", "source_sha256": "bd17375593d8ffa2084b5fa2a7ab5c7498400795e7e8cccf8dc1f46c73187985", "ja": "それいいですね！　よーし、はりきって\nカワイイドリンク作っちゃいますよっ！", "zh": "好主意！好——那我就打起精神，做出可爱的饮料吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_6102_006mak", "source_sha256": "398c3d4a22293b6658de692a0b5f4ea9fc3a1ed877469739497ef8a23e8dbe29", "ja": "シロップは何色にしようかな～。あとリンゴのウサギも\n飾って……えへへ、ボクが一番楽しんじゃうかもです♪", "zh": "糖浆要选什么颜色好呢～。还要装饰上苹果小兔……嘿嘿，说不定最后反而是我玩得最开心呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_6200_p", "source_sha256": "a7a82e9e8ef307428c590dcc8c7ef61212c2f4a421e044584d9f36910baed34f", "ja": "お菓子をお皿に取り分けてあげるのはどうかな。\n特別感があっていいと思うんだけど。", "zh": "要不要把点心分到盘子里呢？\n我觉得这样很有特别的感觉，挺不错的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_6201_006mak", "source_sha256": "8c5450251d75a3ffd690dc6d37fcd5adf1e8fe2991be91d48be591f3b5f46cc8", "ja": "確かに！　でも、取り分ける動作でカワイさを\n表現するのって結構難しそうですね……うーん。", "zh": "确实！不过，想通过分菜的动作来\n表现可爱感，感觉挺难的……嗯——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_6202_006mak", "source_sha256": "861487a5605cf9a3f7bf11e8343b214f352e0b999e790fb96cba24c70b631ca5", "ja": "指でハートを作りながら取り分ける？　……難しいな。\nあとは、猫のポーズで？　いや、ウサギだしなあ。", "zh": "一边用手指比出爱心一边分装？……好难啊。\n还有，摆出猫咪的姿势？不对，明明是兔子嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_6300_p", "source_sha256": "427453ef66e3e032a3bddb1c1480960eb16655b2b3823d24562a4d9163e08761", "ja": "ウサギ跳びレッスンをしよう！\n見てくれた人も健康になれるかも？", "zh": "来做兔跳练习吧！\n说不定连观看的人也能变得更健康？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_6301_006mak", "source_sha256": "732e06b97172c9bf01b0d28324b29421a4fc5b976b1fcd8e8bffdf95c9a8d205", "ja": "ええっ、ウサギ跳びですか？　確かにウサギはカワイイ\nですけど、ウサギ跳びはまた別じゃないですか！？", "zh": "诶诶，要做兔跳练习吗？兔子确实很可爱，\n但兔跳应该是另一回事吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_6302_006mak", "source_sha256": "73d26e0894b9532d148b1f096dbd74a73717b84a437154deec92af280e0fa193", "ja": "……いや、やる前に諦めちゃダメですよね。この衣装と\nウサギ跳びで、カワイさを伝え……られるかなあ？", "zh": "……不对，还没做就放弃可不行呢。穿着这套服装\n再做兔跳，能传达出可爱……的感觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
